OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after 'racist word
OL,4,Awritten on boy's forehead' in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy has been allegedly
OL,7,Fracially assaulted by two older
OL,8,Fchildren in a park, police have said.
OL,10,FLancashire Police said a "racist word
OL,11,Fhad been written on his forehead and
OL,12,Farm with a marker pen" at 18:30 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday, in Harpers Recreation Ground,
OL,14,FChorley.
OL,16,FThe force said it was treating the
OL,17,F"racially aggravated assault" in
OL,18,FHarpers Lane as a "hate crime".
